@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title Vehicle Parking System\nModular Monolith Component Architecture
[React workspace\nAuth context role guards dashboard and inbox] as UI
[REST interface\nJWT permissions and strict serializers] as GUARD
package "Domain application" as DOMAIN {
  [Accounts and vehicles] as ACC
  [Zones and slots] as SLOT
  [Reservations] as RES
  [Parking operations] as OPS
  [Rates and billing] as BILL
  [Reports and exports] as REP
}
[Common services\nSafe errors audit and notifications] as COMMON
[Django ORM\nAtomic transactions and row locks] as ORM
database "PostgreSQL\nIndexes foreign keys and conditional uniqueness" as DB
UI --> GUARD : REST JSON and Bearer JWT
GUARD --> DOMAIN : validated requests
OPS --> SLOT : guarded transitions
OPS --> RES : reservation linkage
OPS --> BILL : fee calculation
DOMAIN --> COMMON : shared policies and events
DOMAIN --> ORM : persistence
COMMON --> ORM : append events and alerts
ORM --> DB : parameterized SQL
note bottom of COMMON
Notification dispatch runs after commit.
Audit persistence follows each domain contract.
end note
@enduml
